/*!
    \module QTerm
    \title QTerm C++ Module
    \brief Terminal emulation components for Qt applications.

    The QTerm module provides terminal core models, session backends and UI
    integration types for both Qt Widgets and Qt Quick.

    Public API groups:
    \list
    \li Core models and session control
    \li Local shell, serial and telnet backends
    \li Theme and surface projection types
    \li Widgets and Qt Quick terminal views
    \endlist
*/
